  "about": {
    "title": "About the Ancient Origins set",
    "paragraphs": [
      "Pokémon TCG: Ancient Origins is an XY expansion released on 12 August 2015. It has 101 cards: 98 in the main set, 2 secret rares and 1 alternate version. There are also 73 reverse holos.",
      "Choose what you’re collecting: the <b>Standard set</b> (the 98 main set cards), the <b>Master set</b> (171 cards, adding the reverse holos) or the <b>Grand Master set</b> (all 174 cards, adding the 2 secret rares and 1 alternate version).",
      "This free checklist lets you tick off the cards you own, count spare copies for trading, see your progress by rarity and plan your binder pages. It works on phones and computers, even offline, and your collection stays on your device."
